Z||000003||WKDFIRO||01-02-2001||01:27 AM||||Nice gapping maw you got there!<P>While the engine is out you can tear out that shabby fiberglass on the strut towers! I took mine off and it just looks so much cleaner! I used gloves and a mask because they do collect dust! Its supposedly for abosorbing noise from the engine but I never heard a difference either inside or outside...but then I was really building a quiet engine to begin with.||||reg||10
